  "content_en": "Chapter 1 First Marriage The slightly cold wind of the Prince's Mansion blew into the house through the unclosed red peach wood door, carrying the faint fragrance of flowers. It messed up the black hair that Xiao Xi had just smoothed for Luo Xue. In the room that had been silent for a long time, Xiao happy complained helplessly, breaking the shackles of silence. \"It's so annoying, I have to do it again.\" Xiao happy said bitterly. She looked at her master in the mirror and frowned, fearing that her thoughts were not here at all. It was obvious that her master was unhappy. She had been with Luo Xue for four and a half years. During this not-so-long relationship, she had become familiar with Luo Xue's routine and the barometer of her mood. It seems that after the fortune teller appeared, the lady became unhappy, but why on earth was she unhappy? Xiao happy was thinking while fiddling with Luo Xue's hair. She accidentally used too much force and woke up Luo Xue in pain. \"Ah.\" Luo Xue murmured softly. \"Miss, does it hurt? It's all Xiao Xi's fault.\" \"It doesn't hurt, girl, what were you thinking about just now?\" \"I'm wondering what the miss is thinking about? Miss, what are you thinking about?\" Two faint dimples appeared on Xiao Xi's face. \"Young lady won't tell me. Are you wondering what Xiao Xi is thinking?\" \"What? Are you trying to make excuses?\" Luo Xue turned her head and looked at this weird girl. Xiao Xi stuck out her tongue, \"Miss, were you thinking about what the fortune teller said just now? Ever since you met that fortune teller, everything has changed, and Miss has become more and more interested in being in a daze.\" \"Xiao Xi, how can I not tell you not to mention this matter again?\" Luo Xue's face showed a rare seriousness, and Xiao Xi's curiosity was suppressed in this way. There was silence in the room again. After a while, Luo Xue, who noticed something strange, changed the subject and asked: \"Xiao Xi, have I become more beautiful? They say that the newlywed bride is the most beautiful.\" Xiao Xi looked at the mirror seriously and nodded, \"I have indeed become beautiful. But I'm still not pretty enough. \"Liang, something is missing.\" \"What's missing?\" \"It's missing my hair that Xiao Xi combed herself.\" \"Since you know that, why don't you dress me up quickly?\" As Xiao Xi said, everything changed when she met the fortune teller. A month ago, Luo Xue and Xiao happy had just returned from the Guanyin Temple. They didn't want to be stopped by a fortune teller. He shook his feather fan and said to Luo Xue: \"It must be Miss Yang. I am here to say hello to Miss Yang.\" \"There are so many Miss Yang. How do you know that you have found the wrong person?\" Luo Xue was not interested in his happy event. \"There are many Miss Yang, but Miss Yang in Meiyuan, I'm afraid there is only Miss Luo Xue, right?\" Bu Tian smiled confidently. There was a feeling of being seen through by others, but the lady from Meiyuan could not show her inner feelings easily, not to mention that Luo Xue read a bit of provocation in his smile. She asked calmly: \"Then I dare to ask sir, where did Luo Xuexi come from?\" \"Miss is so lucky, I'm afraid she will marry into the prince's palace within a month.\" \"Sir, you are kind to me, Luo Xue is not a person of high fate, and has never been destined to be a descendant of the prince's palace. Xiaoxi rewards you.\" After that, she was about to leave. \"Miss, how can you send Bu Tian away with just a few taels of silver?\" He paused, \"Miss Yang is destined to return to the palace, I'm afraid she won't be able to escape.\" \"Luo Xue already has someone she cares about, sir, please don't ruin your reputation for Luo Xue.\" There was a hint of warning in Luo Xue's words. Bu Tian still smiled, \"As long as the lady finds her home, what does a sign mean? If the prince truly regards you as his princess, then he is the destined marriage for the lady.\" After saying that, he shook his fan and left. \"Arrogant person, Xiao happy, let's go.\" \"Miss, is the person you just talked about brother Xunyang?\" \"What is it?\" \"That's the person in the young lady's heart.\" Xiao Xi looked at her and chased her in three steps and two steps. Looking at it, she knew that when a young lady wanted to escape, she would usually walk the fastest, \"Is it brother Xunyang?\" \"There is no one you care about. I just want to make the fortune teller more interesting and talk nonsense.\" After that, she quickened her pace again. \"It must be.\" \"He stinks of copper, that's not it.\" \"It must be, miss, please walk slower.\" \"Girl, it's time to go home, otherwise dad will be unhappy.\" \"Oh, miss just likes brother Xunyang!\" The red sunset, with the passage of time, became the entire dome, and then slowly faded away with the passage of time. It came and went, repeated several times, and a few days passed. The late-ripening plum blossoms in the plum garden have become a new contender for favor in the loneliness of early spring. They proudly exude their not-so-dignified fragrance. For the sake of momentary glory, they do not hesitate to let themselves be exposed in the cold wind.Gradually the fragrance disappears. Luo Xue, who was sitting in the small pavilion, was stroking the lyre with her slender hands, playing it carefully against the scenery. Every time it hits a sentimental part, it always breaks off and doesn't continue, as if it's afraid of touching the mournful undead in the piano. Luo Xue always believed that the lyre's ability to play sad and lonely tunes must be related to its legend. Legend has it that there was a qin player in the capital who was very good at playing the qin. She always liked to play ditties on full moon nights, so whenever the moon was full, the business of the Green House was particularly good. Later, a nobleman gave him a lyre and told him not to play it at night. Qin Ling loves this piano very much. The lyre, as its name suggests, has seven strings, and the strings are condensed. Once you get started with it, the music will flow out like an underground spring. Once, on the 15th day of the eighth month, the qin player became very popular and played and sang it under the moonlight. But the tune is sad. It was as if someone was crying out his sorrow through her hands and her songs. One song after another, the sadness remains the same. Even if her fingers are worn out, Qin Ling has no intention of stopping. At the end of that night, Qin Ling disappeared, and so did Qin. Some people say that the piano player's hand was injured and disabled during the selfless playing that night. Some people also say that Qin Ling took the lyre with her to search for the soul in the lyre. For a hundred years, rumors spread, and no one knew what happened that night. The lyre changed owners several times during the changes of dynasties. As fate would have it, it fell into Luo Xue's hands. Luo Xue also loved this piano as much as Qin Ling. Whenever she had free time, she would always play with it a few times. Even if the moon was bright in the sky, she could not recreate Qin Ling's selfless state. Looking at the light red strings, Luo Xue occasionally thought that the undead souls in the piano were already tired, and the things that needed to be told had already been told in the long period of wandering. Whenever she thinks of the legend of the lyre, Luo Xue always wants to play \"Butterfly Sorrow\" that she heard as a child. The whole song is melancholy and sad. It tells the bitterness of a concubine after she was favored. She had no intention of harming others, but she was betrayed by a trusted person and was eventually buried in Butterfly Valley. Luo Xue couldn't play that kind of artistic conception. After all, this song ran through all the happiness of her childhood. Many times, Luo Xue always thinks, isn't it ironic to use \"Butterfly\" to highlight her childhood happiness? She had no way of knowing whether it was a satire on \"The Sorrow of the Butterfly\" or on herself, but she felt it was more of the former. But as time goes by, will there be more of the latter? \"Miss, Brother Xunyang is here.\" Xiao Xi's words interrupted Luo Xue's interest. Luo Xue put away her hands, stood up, straightened the plum petals on her clothes, and waited for the guests to arrive. \"Miss, it's so elegant, but why is the tune so sad?\" Xunyang said as he walked. \"Luo Xue can't play the sad mood. I've only heard it a few times, and some parts are very blurry.\" \"Such a beautiful piece of music made me draw a picture casually. I wonder if Miss can enjoy it.\" \"Luo Xue is very interested.\" Luo Xue replied, winking at Xiao Xi, and telling her to take the piano off the table. I want to see what kind of painting this businessman will draw. As Xunyang spread out the drawing paper, Luo Xue's face no longer smiled. She saw a weak butterfly perched on a small flower on the edge of a steep cliff. However, it was raining in the sky, and it would become heavier and heavier. She was so surprised that she thought, didn't he know that he couldn't express sadness? Why would he draw such a painting? \"Master Xun, how could you draw such a scene?\" \"Listening to the young lady playing the piano, Xunyang felt that a butterfly appeared in front of her eyes, flying in the rain. She finally found a flower to rest on, but the rain became heavier and heavier. She waited helplessly. She didn't know whether this waiting was a blessing or a misfortune.\" \"Young Master has a good hearing.\" , this song is called \"Butterfly Sorrow\", and it tells the story of the tragic life of a woman who is like a butterfly. Luo Xue originally thought that she could not play the piano like that, so she asked the young master to beautify the charm. \"Miss, your piano skills are superb, why should you be humble?\" \"You are kidding,\" Luo Xue covered half of her face with her hands and smiled. \"I wonder if the young master has anything to do with Luo Xue?\" \"Luo Xue, are you willing to marry me?\" Xun Yang called Luo Xue by her first name, hoping to eliminate the gap between them. Luo Xue looked at him, but what she was thinking about was the words of the fortune teller Bu Tian. Regarding Bu Tian, ​​Luo Xue asked her father. In more than ten years of bribery, her father Yang Hu had heard the name Bu Tian. He told Luo Xue that Bu Tian appeared in the capital three years ago. He was famous for his ability to pinch and calculate. Such an answer is naturally not good news for Luo Xue. Luo Xue guessed that since her father described it like this, the one named Bu Tian must have some skills. If he could tell accurately, wouldn't she be like the woman from \"The Sorrow of the Butterfly\"?So helpless, it is better to marry the person in front of you. Although he is a wealthy businessman, he is also far away from the palace, which is considered a blessing. \"Luo Xue, I know this is a bit hasty. I can give you a few days to think about it.\" Xunyang said seriously. Luo Xue came back to her senses and smiled back at Xunyang. Even though the lady from Meiyuan was used to smiling at others, she still hoped that her smile this time would show a different feeling. \"Master, do you really not care about Luo Xue's answer?\" \"What does the young lady mean?\" \"If Luo Xue refuses, will the master still be willing to come to Meiyuan to listen to the piano?\" Such obvious words may have some flavor. \"I will, Miss Yang. Xun has something else to do, so I won't bother you.\" \"Young master left in such a hurry, didn't you even give Luo Xue time to hear the answer?\" Luo Xue looked at the figure that did not turn around but stopped in front, and continued: \"What if I said, Luo Xue is willing to take the piano to the master's house and play for you every day?\" Xunyang turned around, \"Do you mean you agree?\" Luo Xue nodded lightly, with a trace of blush on her face. \"Mr. Xun, I'm afraid it won't be good for others to see you.\" \"Call me Xunyang, Luo Xue. I will love you and protect you for the rest of my life. I will send the housekeeper to propose marriage in a while.\" \"Okay, I'll wait for you.\" There was a bang, and she screamed with a little joy, \"Ah. Miss, I didn't mean to do it.\" After the sound disappeared, the lyre was scattered on the ground in pieces. Xiao Xi stood aside shivering, not knowing what would happen. Although he knew that the young lady would not punish him cruelly, the piano was the young lady's favorite thing. The young lady also said that there was only one lyre. Luo Xue frowned, thinking: I'm afraid the undead soul in the piano is tired and doesn't like being disturbed. \"Xiao happy, let's bury it alive.\" \"Bury Qin?\" Xunyang looked at Luo Xue in confusion. Luo Xue smiled silently. But he insisted on telling her: \"Xunyang, you must remember to come and propose marriage.\" In his light words, he ignored the sadness in his heart. \"Okay, wait for me.\" Bu Tian, ​​I really want to smash your sign. Such a bad thought rippled in Luo Xue's heart like the wind. Just because of that slightly provocative look. Luo Xue is so stubborn, even if it means her life, she is not willing to give up easily. After that day, Xunyang disappeared as if he had evaporated from the world. Luo Xue waited day after day, from sunrise to sunset. \"Xunyang, you must come to propose marriage.\" \"Miss, someone has come to propose marriage.\" Xiao happy hurried over. Luo Xue looked at her, \"Xiao Xi, is your lady unable to get married?\" \"Miss, why can't a naturally beautiful girl get married?\" Xiao happy gasped and asked doubtfully. \"Then why are you in such a hurry? Am I just the one who can't marry?\" Luo Xue didn't like her running over shouting like this. \"Aren't I anxious for the young lady? Xiao happy sees the young lady waiting here every day, isn't she waiting? Since she doesn't wait, Xiao Xi will go back.\" Xiao Xi said aggrievedly, turned around and walked away without looking back. \"Xiao happy, where are you going?\" Luo Xue called her, but Xiao happy ignored her. \"Xiao happy, where are you going?\" \"Go wherever you should go.\" Xiao happy said angrily. Luo Xue was anxious and asked helplessly, \"Where are the guests who proposed marriage?\" \"Ha, I knew the lady was impatient. Come on, lady, follow me. The master has arranged them in the main hall.\" After that, Xiao Xi pulled Luo Xue and trotted all the way to the corridors inside and outside the main hall, and quietly hid behind the screen. \"One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight. Miss, it is indeed an eight-carriage sedan.\" Xiao happy said happily. \"Girl, keep your voice down, I'm afraid others will hear you.\" Luo Xue hurriedly blocked Xiao Xi's mouth and didn't let go until Xiao Xi nodded to indicate that she would stop talking. After a while, Yang Hu entered the hall from the front. \"My dear Yang Hu, I just couldn't welcome guests in time due to personal matters. I still need to forgive my negligence.\" \"Mr. Yang is joking. I am the steward of the fifth prince's house. I came here to propose marriage according to the prince's order. According to the prince's wish, I will marry Miss Yang in three days.\" The man who claimed to be the steward stated in a smooth and elegant manner, and his behavior was extremely sophisticated. Luo Xue was suddenly startled. She pulled Xiao happy and quickly left the main hall and walked to the garden before stopping. \"Xiao happy, did that person just say that he was a servant of the prince's house?\" \"That's right, miss, didn't Brother Xunyang say he would come to propose marriage?\" Xiao happy said hesitantly. \"I'm afraid he has something to do, so I'll delay it. Is it really what Bu Tian said? Xiao happy, do you know the Fifth Prince?\" The sky was slightly dark.The setting sun coated Luo Xue's whole body with a layer of sad red. \"Young ladies don't know each other, how could Xiao Xi know her? Miss, do you think the master will agree?\" \"Xiao Xi, I'm tired and want to take a rest. You can go down too. You have to obey your parents' orders for such things.\" The answer to such a question is self-evident. Yang Hu is more important than fame and wealth. How could he give up such an opportunity so easily? After sending Xiao happy away, Luo Xue walked back to Xianggui alone. She sat quietly on the bedside, sometimes smiling bitterly, sometimes sighing. Divination can even predict the fate of the sky, let alone Luo Xue? Luo Xue, maybe you should have died in the turmoil five years ago, why not go back now? He stood up, took out a piece of hemp rope from the cabinet, stepped on the stool, threw it on the beam, wrapped it around the buckle, tied it tightly, and tugged hard to make sure it was very strong, then he stuck his head in, kicked down the stool with both feet, and the person was suspended in the air. The sudden shortness of breath made it difficult for Luo Xue to adapt. She didn't want to make the final struggle. If she broke free from the rope buckle, wouldn't all her previous efforts be wasted? It's better to wait quietly. She felt that the blood in her body was continuously rising up, filling her already red head. She wanted to wait for death like this. While waiting quietly, the time seemed particularly long. She clearly felt that her heartbeat was constantly accelerating, and she could also hear her increasingly clear heartbeat telling her that it did not want to die. She closed her eyes silently, placing herself on the edge of despair and death. \"Miss, I think it's better for me to accompany you.\" Xiao happy opened the door, and the scene in front of her panicked her. \"Come here, the lady hanged herself, come here quickly.\" Luo Xue had no way of knowing what happened next. When she opened her eyes, she saw her father Yang Hu, \"Dad.\" \"Luo Xue, why are you so stupid?\" Yang Hu felt sorry for her daughter, but didn't know how to persuade her. Luo Xue turned away and said nothing. \"I know that the palace is not a good place, but I am also helpless. I saw my father being framed and died in prison. For more than ten years, I have been trying to win over people's hearts, just to find someone who can clear the name of the Yang family. Luo Xue, although you are not mine, I have treated you like my own son for the past five years. I don't want to ruin your happiness.\" Yang Hu expressed her grievances gracefully. Luo Xue had heard such words many times. Luo Xue knew that the moment Yang Hu brought her into Meiyuan, she was destined to be a victim of power trading. For many years, she has been living according to his arrangement. She knows her father's suffering, but has his father ever understood her heart? \"Luo Xue, in fact, Xunyang is the fifth prince. I have been hiding this from you. If you care about him, don't do stupid things anymore.\" \"What? Xunyang is the prince?\" A trace of tears flowed from Luo Xue's eyes, \"It's hard for dad to lie to his daughter. It turns out that even close relatives can also cheat Luo Xue.\" \"Child, dad wants to...\" Yang Hu was speechless for a moment. \"Dad, I'm tired. My daughter understands my father's feelings. Don't worry, I won't seek death. In three days, I will marry into the palace in a sedan chair.\" After that, he closed his eyes and fell asleep. The blows come one after another, like disasters that never come alone. If Xunyang concealed her and deceived her, she could forgive her, but what should she do if her close relatives, whom she trusted, joined forces with outsiders to treat her in this way? So what? Who among the people around you can be trusted? In terms of power and low status, I am afraid that women are just foils, and they are rarely alive among the victims. In this case, it's better to comply with their wishes and just get married.",
